    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581450/extras/35bc0e0e992c79a18072e78c6aa7c6b1.avif?t=1740006481\" width=592 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a guest in this very particular hotel in Angel City. The room has been paid for few days by the company and you have a lot of free time. Take your time to explore the hotel, enjoy the view and meet the other residents but remember, <strong>you must not say a word.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A swap puzzle game set in a strange hotel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581450/extras/a655aa3c5a3c9a5b16b99c5e6a46cbb1.avif?t=1740006481\" width=630 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, swap images and unlock cards!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore the Hotel VIP freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Meet the other residents and interact with them without talking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Solve little swap minigames to unlock images.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Is it that easy ?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - 18 Clues to collect in total (40 with DLC).<br><br>- 4 Rooms to discover<br><br>- 16 pictures to unlock\u00a0 (80 with DLC)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581450/extras/084da526ccc06ad63fd43fe2011a8865.poster.avif?t=1740006481\" width=592 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581450/extras/084da526ccc06ad63fd43fe2011a8865.webm?t=1740006481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581450/extras/084da526ccc06ad63fd43fe2011a8865.mp4?t=1740006481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All 3D arts by JUL3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581450/extras/3f487d369bbec0832dd18765411fd8d9.avif?t=1740006481\" width=592 height=325 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581450/extras/35bc0e0e992c79a18072e78c6aa7c6b1.avif?t=1740006481\" width=592 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a guest in this very particular hotel in Angel City. The room has been paid for few days by the company and you have a lot of free time. Take your time to explore the hotel, enjoy the view and meet the other residents but remember, <strong>you must not say a word.</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A swap puzzle game set in a strange hotel</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581450/extras/a655aa3c5a3c9a5b16b99c5e6a46cbb1.avif?t=1740006481\" width=630 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, swap images and unlock cards!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore the Hotel VIP freely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Meet the other residents and interact with them without talking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Solve little swap minigames to unlock images.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Is it that easy ?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > - 18 Clues to collect in total (40 with DLC).<br><br>- 4 Rooms to discover<br><br>- 16 pictures to unlock\u00a0 (80 with DLC)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581450/extras/084da526ccc06ad63fd43fe2011a8865.poster.avif?t=1740006481\" width=592 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581450/extras/084da526ccc06ad63fd43fe2011a8865.webm?t=1740006481\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581450/extras/084da526ccc06ad63fd43fe2011a8865.mp4?t=1740006481\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All 3D arts by JUL3D.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2581450/extras/3f487d369bbec0832dd18765411fd8d9.avif?t=1740006481\" width=592 height=325 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
